hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"62","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Mswalie Muhammad na aali za Muhammad kama Ulivyomswalia Ibrahim na aali za Ibrahim; hakika Wewe ni Msifiwa, Mtukufu. Ewe Allah! Mbariki Muhammad na aali za Muhammad kama Ulivyombariki Ibrahim na aali za Ibrahim; hakika Wewe ni Msifiwa, Mtukufu. [Swala katika swala]"
"63","[AI-translation] Ewe Allah! Mswalie Muhammad, wake zake, na kizazi chake kama Ulivyomswalia aali za Ibrahim. Na mbariki Muhammad, wake zake, na kizazi chake kama Ulivyombariki aali za Ibrahim; hakika Wewe ni Msifiwa, Mtukufu."
